    {
      "id": "auto-reconnect-handler",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -10,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Auto-Reconnect Handler\n\nTerminalContext\n.onSessionsRestored()\n\n1. Filter by context\n2. Claim ownership\n3. Request data port",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "event",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "status": "draft",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/contexts/TerminalContext.tsx"
        ],
        "event": {
          "name": "terminal.session.auto_reconnect",
          "description": "Auto-reconnecting to restored session",
          "attributes": {
            "session.id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Session being reconnected"
            },
            "context": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Terminal context for filtering"
            },
            "reconnect.success": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Whether reconnection succeeded"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reconnect-gap-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "RECONNECTION GAP (BUG)\n\nCurrent behavior:\n1. App restarts\n2. Sessions restored from daemon\n3. Tabs appear (from session list)\n4. BUT no auto-reconnect!\n5. User must click each tab\n\nFix: Listen for SESSIONS_RESTORED\nand auto-trigger reconnection\nfor matching context sessions.",
      "color": "#EF4444"
    },
    {
      "id": "reconnect-error",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -10,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "Reconnect Error\n\nOwnership denied or\nport delivery failed",
